      <div class="q-section-hdr">
        <h3>Questions 14–17</h3>
        <p>The reading passage has eight paragraphs, <b>A–H</b>.<br>
        Which paragraph contains the following information?<br>
        Write the correct letter, <b>A–H</b>, in the boxes below.</p>
      </div>

      <div id="para-blocks"><div class="para-block" id="parablock-14">
      <div class="para-row"><span class="para-num">14</span><span class="para-stmt">a description of the characteristics common to songs that become earworms</span></div>
      <div class="para-select-wrap">
        <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">14</strong><select class="para-select" id="practice_single_reading_29_14_" name="practice_single_reading_29_14" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 14">
